{"page":176,"width":1652,"height":2360,"text_angle":0,"lines":[{"text":"된 대하여 \"기운다. 이 연결된 표현은 포인터를 서용하여 데이터","words":[{"text":"된","x":413,"y":177,"width":25,"height":31},{"text":"대하여","x":832,"y":180,"width":74,"height":32},{"text":"\"기운다.","x":921,"y":181,"width":85,"height":32},{"text":"이","x":1022,"y":181,"width":23,"height":32},{"text":"연결된","x":1061,"y":181,"width":81,"height":32},{"text":"표현은","x":1156,"y":182,"width":84,"height":32},{"text":"포인터를","x":1253,"y":183,"width":117,"height":32},{"text":"서용하여","x":1383,"y":184,"width":110,"height":32},{"text":"데이터","x":1508,"y":186,"width":69,"height":37}]},{"text":"들을 연결한다. 연결된 표현은 널리 시`루되며 추심 데이터 터 입 “리스트”의 구현에만 시용되는 것","words":[{"text":"들을","x":412,"y":230,"width":54,"height":31},{"text":"연결한다.","x":476,"y":229,"width":111,"height":32},{"text":"연결된","x":601,"y":229,"width":76,"height":32},{"text":"표현은","x":687,"y":230,"width":78,"height":32},{"text":"널리","x":774,"y":230,"width":49,"height":34},{"text":"시`루되며","x":836,"y":232,"width":101,"height":34},{"text":"추심","x":949,"y":234,"width":49,"height":32},{"text":"데이터","x":1012,"y":235,"width":78,"height":32},{"text":"터","x":1104,"y":235,"width":21,"height":32},{"text":"입","x":1133,"y":235,"width":22,"height":32},{"text":"“리스트”의","x":1168,"y":236,"width":134,"height":32},{"text":"구현에만","x":1315,"y":237,"width":119,"height":32},{"text":"시용되는","x":1444,"y":238,"width":105,"height":33},{"text":"것","x":1559,"y":246,"width":19,"height":30}]},{"text":"이 아니고 다른 여러 가지의 자료구조(트리. 그리|프. 스택. 큐) 등을 구현히는데도 많이 시용된다","words":[{"text":"이","x":412,"y":281,"width":24,"height":32},{"text":"아니고","x":448,"y":282,"width":80,"height":32},{"text":"다른","x":537,"y":280,"width":52,"height":33},{"text":"여러","x":598,"y":281,"width":50,"height":33},{"text":"가지의","x":661,"y":282,"width":73,"height":33},{"text":"자료구조(트리.","x":747,"y":283,"width":170,"height":36},{"text":"그리|프.","x":930,"y":288,"width":86,"height":32},{"text":"스택.","x":1029,"y":288,"width":61,"height":32},{"text":"큐)","x":1104,"y":2